OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 470 homes and primary
OL,4,Aschool approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for 470 homes on the edge of a
OL,7,Fvillage in Leicestershire have been
OL,8,Fgiven the go-ahead.
OL,10,FHinckley and Bosworth Borough Council's
OL,11,Fplanning committee approved a planning
OL,12,Fapplication on Tuesday from Lagan Homes
OL,13,FLtd for a housing development and a
OL,14,Fprimary school on land off Burroughs
OL,15,FRoad Recreation Ground in Ratby.
OL,17,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,18,Fsaid the application would be subject
OL,19,Fto a Section 106 legal agreement in
OL,20,Fwhich the developer will pay #10m
OL,21,Ftowards services in the area.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
