OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 470 homes and primary
OL,4,Aschool approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Marsh, representing the applicant
OL,7,FLagan Homes, said the proposals would
OL,8,Fgo towards the "considerable shortfall"
OL,9,Fof homes within the borough and would
OL,10,Fprovide "wider benefits" to the area.
